    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562980/extras/ed07720d34d4fde9aa21b2cccbc4b2f2.avif?t=1753819103\" /></span><br><br><strong>Kwark</strong> is a single-player game in which you are a character named <i><strong>Kwark</strong></i>!<br>Your <strong>main task</strong> is to complete all levels, but it's not as easy as it seems!<br>A lot of levels available for passing, character customization, in-game currency and qualitatively made menu will not let you get bored.<br>In <strong>Kwark</strong> there is a large functionality of settings, such as: full screen mode, game graphics selection, sound settings and much more!<br><strong>Kwark</strong> can run, jump, crouch, walk in a crouch and jump in a crouch, in general, everything you need for a comfortable game!<br>The game has a menu with a large number of buttons such as, mechanics, good design and elaborate interface!<br>And localization between <strong>Russian, English and Polish</strong> will allow you to play as you feel comfortable.<br>Also frequent updates won't let you get bored!<br><strong><i>Can you pass all the levels?</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562980/extras/ed07720d34d4fde9aa21b2cccbc4b2f2.avif?t=1753819103\" /></span><br><br><strong>Kwark</strong> is a single-player game in which you are a character named <i><strong>Kwark</strong></i>!<br>Your <strong>main task</strong> is to complete all levels, but it's not as easy as it seems!<br>A lot of levels available for passing, character customization, in-game currency and qualitatively made menu will not let you get bored.<br>In <strong>Kwark</strong> there is a large functionality of settings, such as: full screen mode, game graphics selection, sound settings and much more!<br><strong>Kwark</strong> can run, jump, crouch, walk in a crouch and jump in a crouch, in general, everything you need for a comfortable game!<br>The game has a menu with a large number of buttons such as, mechanics, good design and elaborate interface!<br>And localization between <strong>Russian, English and Polish</strong> will allow you to play as you feel comfortable.<br>Also frequent updates won't let you get bored!<br><strong><i>Can you pass all the levels?</i></strong>",
